   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PIMS-10120-PPG-Building Climate |Resilience for Vulnerable Groups in rural and Urban areas of Yemen</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of the GEF PPG is to develop the project concept into a full project: Building Climate Resilience for vulnerable Groups in Rural and Urban areas of Yemen. As described in the project concept (PIF), this project aims to increase resilience of vulnerable households against the impacts of climate change through enhanced food security, improved land/water resource management, improved livestock husbandry, increased access to modern energy services, and strengthened local capacity in se</narrative>
  </description>
